     the bot's inventory, approvals with "Takas sende" and the first sight, the audit log, fine-tuning, receipts, talk and tag
     settings, bought credits). The words are the launcher's and the site's (apps/launcher/src/locales/tr-afkplus.ts,
     afkplus-free.md §7.6), so the three surfaces read as one product. Short, sentence case, "sen"; no case ending after a
     player's name ("ile", "için" or a colon instead); amounts carry the game's money, never lira. -->
